              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Standard 52-card deck. Aces are generally high.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'One standard 52-card deck.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Each player receives 13 cards. The dealer rotates clockwise.',
